SUMMARY:Casual Ride (D) - IC Almost Paradise (28R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Jan Zerfoss\
 nAnticipated Average Pace for D rides: (12-14 mph)\nRoute: [Almost Paradis
 e](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ic-almost-paradise-28r/)\n**Be
  Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a Casual D Class ride. T
 he ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended
  to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader 
 will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regrouping
 s and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\n
 Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group
 . If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encou
 raged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 12-14 mph average is beyond
  your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.
 \n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repa
 ir kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate pas
 sing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Me
 etup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a
  club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to 
 abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancast
 erbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\
